<title>USA: PHLX to list four new equity options Tuesday.</title>
<headline>PHLX to list four new equity options Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange (PHLX) said Monday it will list options on four stocks on Tuesday, July 29.</p>
<p>The stocks include: Cole National Corp, Eagle USA Airfreight Inc, Frontier Insurance Group Inc and PAXAR Corp.</p>
<p>The following table lists the stocks' ticker symbols, the options' exercise prices, expiration months, position limits and specialist.</p>
<p>Ticker	Strikes	 Expir	 Pos Lts  Specialist</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------  </p>
<p>[CNJ.N]     40, 45, 50    Aug, Sep,   4,500    Group One Ltd</p>
<p>				  Nov, Feb</p>
<p>[EUSA.O]     25, 30, 35    Aug, Sep,   4,500    TFM Investment</p>
<p>				  Nov, Feb</p>
<p>[FTR.N]     25, 30, 35    Aug, Sep,   4,500    TFM Investment</p>
<p>				  Oct, Jan</p>
<p>[PXR.N]     17-1/2, 20,   Aug, Sep,   4,500    TFM Investment</p>
<p>		22-1/2	  Nov, Feb</p>
<p>((--Chicago derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
